Ego Death is about letting go. Ego Suicide is about doing it yourself, on your terms, with the music as the instrument. That's the Polyphia track's thesis. Walking on the Moon's thesis is the same — moving fast without feeling the gravity. Put them together and you get a track about deliberate transcendence with a groove spine.

