That's the depth right there. RGB gives the visual language + base modulation, Dark Souls stats give the precision tuning. Each ball type = RGB modifier + stat distribution.

RGB channels → stat affinity:

R=Power → Vigor (HP), Strength (damage, knockback)
G=Rhythm → Endurance (stamina), Dexterity (speed, timing windows)
B=Range → Intelligence (chain radius), Arcane (special effects)
So a ball could be: R-dominant / VIG-15 / END-8 / STR-20 — a heavy hitter with high HP. Or G-B hybrid / END-20 / DEX-18 / INT-15 — a speed/finesse build with area chains.

